{"agency_id": "ruapehu-district-council", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kSaWyQN5w40", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:50:34+00:00", "content": "Celebrating Taumarunui's Rail Heritage - Saturday 23 August 2025\n\nAround 300 people gathered in Taumarunui on Saturday 23 August to celebrate the township’s rich rail heritage.\n\nA highlight of the day was a journey in historic carriages pulled by a steam locomotive from Glenbrook Vintage Railway. The trip from Taumarunui to Ongarue offered passengers stunning views of the Ruapehu–King Country landscape as the train followed the Ongarue River.\n\nIn Ongarue, passengers visited the memorial to the 1923 Ongarue rail disaster. On 6 July that year, an overnight express struck a landslip, claiming 17 lives and injuring 28 of the 200 people on board. It was the first major rail tragedy in New Zealand’s history.\n\nThe event blended enjoyment of the region’s rail past with a moment of reflection, honouring both the joy and the challenges of the railway’s legacy.\n\nIf your planning a trip to Ruapehu consider travelling on the Northern Explorer which stops in Taumarunui, Waimarino-National Park and Ohakune. \nSee: visitruapehu.com or greatjourneysnz.com", "content_hash": "f2220ffee23830538c06d800425eca6b1ce7874bdbef9297f058d7e417e7c58a", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCpmTz-YRTGAK3aXcS4ueFmA", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCpmTz-YRTGAK3aXcS4ueFmA", "source_id": "ruapehu-district-council-youtube-82e0b92f", "video_id": "kSaWyQN5w40"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-26T00:06:21+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-08\\a9254e1bd6f2125762acf48f.json", "record_id": "youtube:a9254e1bd6f2125762acf48f", "source_account": "UCpmTz-YRTGAK3aXcS4ueFmA", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpmTz-YRTGAK3aXcS4ueFmA"}
