{"agency_id": "te-hiringa-mahara", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MOYC9Vo70Tc", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:50:52+00:00", "content": "Achieving equitable wellbeing outcomes for tāngata whaiora: what we know, what needs to change\n\nTe Hiringa Mahara hosted a webinar outlining findings from our 2025 Assessment of wellbeing for people who interact with mental health and addiction services.\n\nThe assessment released on 25 June is our first assessment comparing the status of wellbeing for people who interact with mental health and addiction services when compared compared to the rest of the population. It found that people who interact with mental health and addiction services experience systemic disadvantage in access to the determinants of mental health and wellbeing. This includes: lower household income; fewer social connections; and poorer individual, family and whānau wellbeing.\n\nThe panel discussed findings from the assessment, approaches to improving wellbeing for whānau Māori, and lived experience perspectives of social determinants.\n\nOur speakers were:\n\nAlex El Amanni, Addiction Practitioner and Counsellor, Te Hiringa Mahara board member\nLaura Ross, Kaitohu Mātaamua o te Pūnaha Toiora | Principal Advisor Wellbeing System, Te Hiringa Mahara\nProfessor Te Kani Kingi, Executive Director of Research and Innovation at Te Whare Wānanga o Awanuiārangi\nThe session will be hosted by Dr Ella Cullen, Kaiwhakahaere Pūnaha Toiora Arataki | Director of Wellbeing System Leadership, Te Hiringa Mahara.", "content_hash": "58323b401fbd27a5cc296c45ce7677705f3b38e6f5a0d1e81aefd253e9c07d86", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UChFbkyy3ZOdOsAjnOW4pAlA", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UChFbkyy3ZOdOsAjnOW4pAlA", "source_id": "te-hiringa-mahara-youtube-9c327f16", "video_id": "MOYC9Vo70Tc"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-04T23:43:10+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-08\\e60d5781cef6d92b4396e4cb.json", "record_id": "youtube:e60d5781cef6d92b4396e4cb", "source_account": "YouTube \n                                     (opens in a new window)", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@tehiringamahara6861"}
